	(text "Main board JST 1x06 pinout: 1=ROWn, 2..6=COL0..4\nSpecial cable: main 1 -> button 2 (ROW); main 2..6 -> button 3..7\nButton-side pin1 (LED supply) and pin8 (LED return) are not wired to main.\nSWD: wire to Pico module debug pads (SWDIO/SWCLK/GND); not on symbol.\nCrossings without a junction dot are not connected."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 20.32 363.22 0)
