	(text "Upper Panel DDI main board (perfboard) — firmware: upper_panel_ddi\nMatrix: 8x5 (GP2-9 rows out, GP10-14 cols in, pulldown in FW)\nIMCP: USB CDC on Pico Micro-USB (115200 logical); GP0/GP1 UART NC\nPower: USB VBUS; max_power 100 mA in firmware USB descriptor\nEight J1..J8 (1x06 each): Pin1 ROW0-7 -> GP2-9 | Pin2-6 COL0-4 -> GP10-14\nSpecial cable to button_panel 1x08; button-side pins 1 and 8 are not wired"
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
